Speed Dating for Singles in Nashville | Speed Dating Event tickets. $25 - $29.
Pre-Dating Memphis Speed Dating Singles Events - Monthly Parties in Memphis.
who do all types of activities all over the Midsouth! Everything from hikin.

=== Text #15 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]This Tuesday, October 9th, we will taste through the line of Bayou Rum from Louisiana, distilled from locally grown sugarcane and molasses.
Welcome Punch will be poured at 8:30pm and will start the tasting at 9p sharp.
This event is free for Caña Rum Bar members, $15 for non-members.

=== Text #16 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Meet the fighters post event to see who take homes fight of the night bonuses.
Special drink discounts starting at just 100baht, free entry, and FMD style good times.
Chat with the Ring Girls, chill by the pool, lounge on the astroturfed roof top and enjoy a classic mix of music from all genres.

=== Text #17 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Walked around Lake Merritt. Played two hours of the text adventure Firebird. Took BART into SF and went to dinner at Pane e Vino with my father's brother's ex-wife and her new boyfriend, a widower from a 55-year marriage.
Said goodbye; she leaves for Vegas in the morning to visit some college friends.

=== Text #18 ===
> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]View alumni that have participated in Mendota High School Basketball. If you participated in Basketball while at Mendota HS, register now and add your name to the list with a message to your old friends.
Looking for Mendota alumni who participated in Basketball but are not listed? Classmates.com® has hundreds of more Mendota alumni listed.

